      "en": "Independent football career prototype with the 3D 3.6.6 WORLD DETAIL renderer: safe throw-ins without restart loops, deterministically unique stadiums, detailed buildings and terrain around the pitch, streets with traffic, pedestrians, litter, match infrastructure and aircraft with twin contrails. The entire environment is a visual layer and does not change physics or AI."
