      "en": "<p class=\"gold\"><b>TRUE ENDING</b></p><p>You defeated 11 opponents and then 11 players from your own team.</p><p>The police and military were called but did not arrive because they are afraid of you.</p><p>Everyone around you pretends that nothing happened.</p><p>All of your character’s stats have been set to <b>99</b>.</p><p>Match score at the time it ended: <b>"
